# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout. pluvian is a
# cross-platform project (CI runs on Linux; contributors on Windows/macOS),
# and the Prettier gate expects LF — this keeps line endings stable
# regardless of a checkout's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.wasm binary
